<title>USA: BankAmerica bought back 4.7 mln shrs in Q4.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica bought back 4.7 mln shrs in Q4.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANSISCO 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Corp said on Wednesday that it repurchased 4.7 million shares of its common stock during the fourth quarter of 1996 at an average price of $95.39 per share.</p>
<p>The company said that this reduced stockholder equity by $450 million.</p>
<p>BankAmerica bought back 17.0 million shares in 1996, at an average price of $79.39, reducing stockholder equity by $1.35 billion.</p>
<p>Total stockholder equity at December 31, 1996 was $20.7 billion.</p>
</text>
